1
00:00:00,205 --> 00:00:04,165
...and I made a teeny-tiny mistake
on the specifications for the diverter valve.

2
00:00:04,334 --> 00:00:05,504
How teeny-tiny?

3
00:00:05,669 --> 00:00:07,549
It's gonna fail after about 10 flushes.

4
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:11,510
- But the mission is for six months.
- That's the code red.

5
00:00:12,426 --> 00:00:15,516
(Howard:)It's kind of like a jack-in-the-box.
No one knows exactly when...

6
00:00:15,679 --> 00:00:19,889
(Howard:)...but at some point, something way worse
than a puppet is gonna pop out of that box.

7
00:00:21,435 --> 00:00:22,935
(Sheldon:)Have you notified NASA?

8
00:00:23,103 --> 00:00:25,853
You crazy? What am I gonna say?
I screwed up your toilet...

9
00:00:26,022 --> 00:00:30,152
(Howard:)...and pretty soon there's gonna be crap
floating all over your nice space station?

10
00:00:30,318 --> 00:00:31,358
(Leonard:)What are you gonna do?

11
00:00:31,528 --> 00:00:34,068
(Howard:)I'm gonna figure out how to fix it,
then I'll tell them.

12
00:00:34,239 --> 00:00:35,739
(Leonard:)So, what do you need us for?

13
00:00:35,907 --> 00:00:38,367
(Raj:)He can't figure out how to fix it.

14
00:00:38,785 --> 00:00:40,575
(Howard:)You said you were gonna be supportive.

15
00:00:40,745 --> 00:00:44,335
(Raj:)I'm trying. But you have to admit,
this is pretty damn funny.

16
00:00:45,709 --> 00:00:46,709
(Sheldon:)I agree.

17
00:00:46,877 --> 00:00:49,547
It's a juxtaposition of the nature
of space exploration...

18
00:00:49,713 --> 00:00:53,383
(Sheldon:)...against the banality of a malfunctioning
toilet that provides the comic fodder here.

19
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,050
[LAUGHS]

20
00:00:58,388 --> 00:01:03,018
(Sheldon:)Check your messages.

